I understand that part of my previous posting didn't work.  Probably
my fault, and I appologise.  Tis is my attempt to repair my mistakes.

This will be a posting of 7 articles, encompasing 6 files in all.
The first (this one) and second will be the documentation for
QEDIT.  strip off the headers, cat them together and uudecode.

Following them will be 6 support files, one per posting.  Strip off
each of their headers and uudecode each one seperately.  

For those who got the origional on any newsgroup other than net.sources, 
I honestly don't know how it got there.. I only posted it to net.sources.
To the one person who didn't like it there because it's not source, sorry
but i've seen enough binaries here to make me think it was ok.

have fun.
